                        2</ref> and <ref target="#d160-f3">3</ref> thereto.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d162-f4" n="4" xml:id="d162-f4-content">
                <p>The memorandum was issued, however, over Irwin’s signature as Chairman of the Under Secretaries’
